            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Netflix stock whipsaws, Ulta & Victoria's Secret earnings",
            "description": "<p>Netflix (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NFLX\">NFLX</a>) stock whipsaws as investors digest the streaming giant's deal with Warner Bros. (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WBD\">WBD</a>).</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance Senior Reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/brooke-dipalma/\">Brooke DiPalma</a> joins Morning Brief host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> to take a closer look at the company's stock moves. Brooke and Julie also take a look at two other trending tickers: Ulta (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ULTA\">ULTA</a>) and Victoria's Secret (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/VSCO\">VSCO</a>).</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
